GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_StevenBefore::
    .string "Quiet down here, isn't it.\p"
    .string "This wall is older than everything\n"
    .string "above it put together. I'm reading\l"
    .string "what it has to say about the\l"
    .string "seabed.\p"
    .string "You've come a long way in. I hope\n"
    .string "it was for a reason.$"

GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_StevenErrand::
    .string "STERN sent you? All the way down\n"
    .string "here?\p"
    .string "…The blank stretch. Of course it\n"
    .string "is.\p"
    .string "I'll tell you what I'd tell him.\n"
    .string "There's nothing blank about it.\l"
    .string "Something down there swallows the\l"
    .string "soundings.\p"
    .string "Don't carry an answer back. Tell\n"
    .string "him I'm coming aboard when he\l"
    .string "sails.\p"
    .string "I've been waiting for a reason to\n"
    .string "leave this wall, and a champion\l"
    .string "turning up in my cave is as good\l"
    .string "as any.$"

GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_StevenTakeThis::
    .string "You walked through the dark to get\n"
    .string "here. Take something for it.$"

GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_ReceivedTM47::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM47 from\n"
    .string "STEVEN!$"

GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_ExplainTM47::
    .string "TM47 is STEEL WING.\p"
    .string "Steel is what's left when the soft\n"
    .string "parts of a rock are gone. I'm fond\l"
    .string "of it.$"

GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_NoRoomForTM47::
    .string "Your BAG won't take it. Come back\n"
    .string "when it will.$"

GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_StevenAfter::
    .string "Tell STERN I meant it about the\n"
    .string "ship.\p"
    .string "And tell him the wreck off ROUTE\n"
    .string "108 is worth a look first. What\l"
    .string "went down with it was made to\l"
    .string "listen to the sea floor.$"
